			"notes": "### Release notes:\n##### Fixed\n- Dimension teams are namespace-aware (`mymod:arena` -> `dimTracker.mymod_arena`), two mods with the same path no longer share a team\n- Placeholders no longer read the player dimension off-thread (Fabric)\n\n##### Changed\n- Deleted teams are recreated on demand with default colors; an admin's manual `/team modify` color is no longer overwritten\n\n---\n\n### Full Changelog:\nhttps://github.com/NikitaCartes/DimensionalTracker/releases"
